      "content": "you say \"spur innovation\" but that sounds like a silver lining that doesn't help me pay my bills next month. honestly it feels like these rules are just being pushed through because they're \"good for the environment\" without anyone actually caring if small shops like mine go under. is there really a valid argument for why these specific mandates need to be so strict right now?",
